    "turn_idx": 64,
    "turn_text": "hit. There was something over the weekend after the Solomani strike that you tweeted about, which caught me. You're talking about revenge. And I would imagine in that immediate aftermath of of grant being killed and of all these other people that it catches you. You want to have revenge. You do. So how do you process that?",
