        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The legitimacy of presidential authority depends on viewing military as a collective national resource.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a moral distinction between using power for national good versus personal gain.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
