    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70766.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 130,
    "turn_text": "What is it? Well, I think what you have to figure out is not what it is, but how to get out of it. So let's say we can't define what war is, but you know the things are bad. Let's get out of it. And the way to do that is through de-escalation, right? And so how does that occur? Well, you have the President's through back channels conveyed to Iran, like, hey, we're all going back to our corners. No more funny business back and forth, and then we'll move from there. The focus should be on trying to bring this down, not necessarily just to define it.",
