    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70766.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 137,
    "turn_text": "Look, I wish I could tell you, I mean, if you were to ask me two weeks ago, I thought that we were in a situation that we were going to be fairly, I was fairly confident that we were gonna be able to pull out of Iraq sooner. You had the Iraqi civilians that were out there protesting, trying to get rid of Iran influence. They were asking for more transparency and less corruption. Governments, if you do those two things, we basically can pull out of there. And now, I don't know.",
