    "turn_text": "I mean, it's scary, but let me tell you, there were dumbasses in the war when I was there, too. I mean, I can't tell you how many times I ended up clearing the same village four times, because somehow one general decided to move us from one place and didn't secure that place. We have some of the best minds that are in the Pentagon. We also have some of the dumbest minds in the Pentagon, and the question is, who's in charge that day? My job is to do the best I can for my constituents and to protect definitely our armed services. While it may be chaotic, I need to keep going. I need to do my job and recognize that this special administration, this will happen a lot more often.",
